<title>USA: Community Investors to buy back stock.</title>
<headline>Community Investors to buy back stock.</headline>
<dateline>BUCYRUS, Ohio 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Community Bancorp Inc said Monday it has received permission from the Office of Thrift Supervision to purchase five percent or 31,647 shares of its total outstanding stock.</p>
<p>President John Kennedy said that the board of directors believes the buyback -- the company's fourth in two and a half years -- is the best utilization of its funds at this time.</p>
</text>
